WEBVTT

00:00:14.211 --> 00:00:15.647
[guttural growl]

00:00:21.784 --> 00:00:23.612
[snarls]

00:00:25.396 --> 00:00:27.311
[purrs]

00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:31.098
[snarls, purrs]

00:00:31.272 --> 00:00:33.361
[snarling, purring]

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:50.595
[dragon exhales]

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.430
[snarls]

00:01:28.242 --> 00:01:29.678
[Gobber] And with one twist,

00:01:29.852 --> 00:01:32.289
he took my hand and
swallowed it whole!

00:01:32.463 --> 00:01:35.510
I saw the look on his face...
I was delicious.

00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:37.773
He must have passed the word,

00:01:37.947 --> 00:01:40.471
because it wasn't a month
before another one of
them took my leg.

00:01:40.645 --> 00:01:44.780
Isn't it weird to think
your hand was inside a dragon?

00:01:44.954 --> 00:01:47.261
Like if your mind was still
in control of it,

00:01:47.435 --> 00:01:50.786
you could have killed
the dragon from inside
by crushing his heart.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:55.835
I swear, I'm so angry. I'll
avenge your beautiful hand
and your beautiful foot.

00:01:56.009 --> 00:01:59.751
I'll chop off the legs
of every dragon I fight,
with my face.

00:02:01.536 --> 00:02:03.581
It's the wings and tail
you really want.

00:02:03.755 --> 00:02:06.149
If it can't fly,
it can't get away.

00:02:06.323 --> 00:02:08.717
A downed dragon
is a dead dragon.

00:02:10.545 --> 00:02:12.373
[yawns]

00:02:12.547 --> 00:02:15.593
All right, I'm off to bed.
You should be, too.

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:18.858
Tomorrow we get to
the big boys,
slowly but surely

00:02:19.032 --> 00:02:22.339
making our way up
to the Monstrous Nightmare.

00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:24.820
But who'll win the honor
of killing it?

00:02:24.994 --> 00:02:27.779
It's gonna be me.
It's my destiny. See?

00:02:27.954 --> 00:02:30.608
[gasps] Your mom
let you get a tattoo?

00:02:30.782 --> 00:02:32.393
[Tuffnut] It's not a tattoo,
it's a birthmark.

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:34.743
[Ruffnut] OK, I've been stuck
with you since birth,

00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:36.832
and that was
never there before.

00:02:37.006 --> 00:02:39.574
[Tuffnut] Yes, it was.
You've just never seen
me from the left side.

00:03:02.031 --> 00:03:04.555
[sizzles]

00:03:19.875 --> 00:03:22.791
[Hiccup] Hey, Toothless.

00:03:22.965 --> 00:03:26.751
I brought breakfast. I hope...
I hope you're hungry.

00:03:27.709 --> 00:03:29.841
OK, that's disgusting.

00:03:30.016 --> 00:03:33.584
We've got some salmon,
some nice Icelandic cod...

00:03:33.758 --> 00:03:35.282
...and a whole smoked eel.

00:03:35.456 --> 00:03:37.240
[snarls]

00:03:40.461 --> 00:03:44.595
- [roars]
- No, no, no, no, no! It's OK.

00:03:44.769 --> 00:03:46.946
Yeah, I don't really
like eel much, either.

00:03:50.601 --> 00:03:52.647
That's it.

00:03:52.821 --> 00:03:55.302
That's it. Just stick
with the good stuff.

00:03:55.476 --> 00:03:58.870
And don't you mind me.
I'll just be back here,

00:03:59.654 --> 00:04:01.917
minding my own business.

00:04:10.926 --> 00:04:12.797
- [grunts]
- [Toothless growls]

00:04:14.408 --> 00:04:15.365
It's OK.

00:04:15.539 --> 00:04:17.715
[grunting]

00:04:25.897 --> 00:04:26.986
OK.

00:04:30.467 --> 00:04:31.991
[guttural growl]

00:04:41.739 --> 00:04:43.002
That's not too bad. It works.

00:04:44.394 --> 00:04:47.571
Whoa! Whooaa!

00:04:47.745 --> 00:04:50.618
No, no, no, no!

00:04:53.925 --> 00:04:55.753
Whoa!

00:05:00.715 --> 00:05:02.847
Oh, my...! It's working!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.942
Yes, yes! I did it!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:15.512
Aaah!

00:05:16.252 --> 00:05:17.862
[shrieks]

00:05:24.739 --> 00:05:25.914
- [Hiccup] Yeah!
- [Gobber] Today
is about teamwork.

00:05:29.265 --> 00:05:32.486
Now, a wet dragon head
can't light its fire.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.707
The Hideous Zippleback
is extra tricky.

00:05:36.881 --> 00:05:40.929
One head breathes gas,
the other head lights it.

00:05:41.103 --> 00:05:44.454
Your job is to know
which is which.

00:05:44.628 --> 00:05:47.936
Razor-sharp serrated teeth
that inject venom
for pre-digestion.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.938
Prefers ambush attack,
crushing its victims...

00:05:50.112 --> 00:05:51.592
Will you please
stop that?!

00:05:51.766 --> 00:05:53.898
[dragon, gurgling]

00:05:55.857 --> 00:05:59.687
If that dragon shows either
of his faces, I'm gonna...

00:05:59.861 --> 00:06:00.905
There!

00:06:01.993 --> 00:06:04.474
Hey, it's us, idiots!

00:06:04.648 --> 00:06:07.651
Your butts are getting bigger.
We thought you were a dragon.

00:06:07.825 --> 00:06:11.829
Not that there's anything
wrong with a
dragonesque figure... Ow!

00:06:12.917 --> 00:06:15.703
- [shouting]
- Wait.

00:06:15.877 --> 00:06:17.008
- [Tuffnut yelling]
- [dragon shrieks]

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.361
Oh, I'm hurt!
I am very much hurt!

00:06:21.535 --> 00:06:23.885
Chances of survival
are dwindling to
single digits now.

00:06:24.059 --> 00:06:26.931
[gurgles, sniffs]

00:06:27.106 --> 00:06:29.934
Whoa, whoa! [stammering]

00:06:30.761 --> 00:06:32.981
Oh. Heh! Wrong head.

00:06:33.634 --> 00:06:35.026
Fishlegs!

00:06:36.898 --> 00:06:38.987
- [gurgles, sparking]
- [Gobber] Now, Hiccup!

00:06:42.121 --> 00:06:43.818
Oh, come on.

00:06:43.992 --> 00:06:46.951
[snarling, roars]

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.129
- Hiccup!
- [dragon shrieks]

00:06:51.652 --> 00:06:54.829
Back, back, back!

00:06:55.003 --> 00:06:58.746
Now, don't you make me
tell you again!
Yes, that's right.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:02.967
Back into your cage.
Now think about
what you've done.

00:07:08.016 --> 00:07:10.149
[growling, muffled]

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.936
OK, so are we done?

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:18.418
'Cause I've got some
things I need to...

00:07:18.592 --> 00:07:20.898
Yep,
I'll see you tomorrow!

